{"seq":2,"slug":"lock-core-ideas","title":"锁的核心思想","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/locks/lock-core-ideas","wordCount":1352,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"锁的核心思想\">锁的核心思想</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>锁的设计围绕三条思想展开：<strong>互斥</strong>、<strong>等待策略</strong>与<strong>死锁预防</strong>。它们分别回答&quot;谁能进入临界区&quot;、&quot;进不去怎么办&quot;以及&quot;多个锁如何不互相卡死&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>关键要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>互斥</strong></td>\n<td>保证数据一致性</td>\n<td>同一时刻只有一个线程进入临界区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>等待策略</strong></td>\n<td>未获取到锁时如何处置</td>\n<td>自旋（忙等）与阻塞（让出 CPU）权衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>死锁预防</strong></td>\n<td>多锁场景下避免循环等待</td>\n<td>统一加锁顺序、超时与死锁检测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P[&quot;多线程访问共享资源&quot;] --&gt; I1[&quot;思想一:互斥&lt;br/&gt;把并行操作串行化&quot;]&#10;  P --&gt; I2[&quot;思想二:等待策略&lt;br/&gt;自旋或阻塞&quot;]&#10;  P --&gt; I3[&quot;思想三:死锁预防&lt;br/&gt;打破循环等待&quot;]&#10;  I1 --&gt; R1[&quot;结果确定,不再依赖调度时序&quot;]&#10;  I2 --&gt; R2[&quot;自旋省切换但耗 CPU,阻塞反之&quot;]&#10;  I3 --&gt; R3[&quot;多锁场景必须统一加锁顺序&quot;]\">graph TD\n  P[\"多线程访问共享资源\"] --&gt; I1[\"思想一:互斥&lt;br/&gt;把并行操作串行化\"]\n  P --&gt; I2[\"思想二:等待策略&lt;br/&gt;自旋或阻塞\"]\n  P --&gt; I3[\"思想三:死锁预防&lt;br/&gt;打破循环等待\"]\n  I1 --&gt; R1[\"结果确定,不再依赖调度时序\"]\n  I2 --&gt; R2[\"自旋省切换但耗 CPU,阻塞反之\"]\n  I3 --&gt; R3[\"多锁场景必须统一加锁顺序\"]</pre><p>三条思想之间存在递进关系：<strong>互斥</strong>保证了正确性，但引入了等待；<strong>等待策略</strong>决定了等待的代价；而当等待涉及多把锁时，就必然需要<strong>死锁预防</strong>——否则线程可能互相等待对方持有的锁，永久阻塞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>锁作为并发编程中最基本的同步工具，其设计背后蕴含着几个关键思想。理解这些思想不仅有助于正确使用锁，更能帮助我们在面对复杂并发问题时做出正确的设计决策。</p>\n<p>锁要解决的根本问题是：<strong>如何在多个线程之间协调对共享资源的访问，保证数据的一致性和程序的正确性</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    PROBLEM[&quot;Multi-threaded Access to Shared Resources&quot;]&#10;&#10;    IDEA1[&quot;Idea 1: Mutual Exclusion&quot;]&#10;    IDEA2[&quot;Idea 2: Blocking and Waiting&quot;]&#10;    IDEA3[&quot;Idea 3: Deadlock Prevention&quot;]&#10;&#10;    PROBLEM --&gt; IDEA1&#10;    PROBLEM --&gt; IDEA2&#10;    PROBLEM --&gt; IDEA3&#10;&#10;    IDEA1 --&gt; R1[&quot;Only One Thread Can Access&lt;br/&gt;the Critical Section at a Time&quot;]&#10;    IDEA2 --&gt; R2[&quot;Threads That Fail to Acquire&lt;br/&gt;Must Choose a Waiting Strategy&quot;]&#10;    IDEA3 --&gt; R3[&quot;In Multi-lock Scenarios&lt;br/&gt;Circular Wait Must Be Prevented&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    PROBLEM[\"Multi-threaded Access to Shared Resources\"]\n\n    IDEA1[\"Idea 1: Mutual Exclusion\"]\n    IDEA2[\"Idea 2: Blocking and Waiting\"]\n    IDEA3[\"Idea 3: Deadlock Prevention\"]\n\n    PROBLEM --&gt; IDEA1\n    PROBLEM --&gt; IDEA2\n    PROBLEM --&gt; IDEA3\n\n    IDEA1 --&gt; R1[\"Only One Thread Can Access&lt;br/&gt;the Critical Section at a Time\"]\n    IDEA2 --&gt; R2[\"Threads That Fail to Acquire&lt;br/&gt;Must Choose a Waiting Strategy\"]\n    IDEA3 --&gt; R3[\"In Multi-lock Scenarios&lt;br/&gt;Circular Wait Must Be Prevented\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心原理\">核心原理</h2><h3 id=\"思想一-互斥-mutual-exclusion\">思想一：互斥（Mutual Exclusion）</h3><p><strong>互斥</strong>是锁最根本的思想——在同一时刻，<strong>只有一个线程</strong>可以进入临界区访问共享资源。所有其他试图进入的线程必须等待。</p>\n<p>这个约束看似简单，但它是保证<strong>数据一致性</strong>的基石。没有互斥，多个线程可以同时修改同一数据，导致最终结果取决于线程调度的时序（即不确定性行为）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 互斥的本质：将并行操作串行化&#10;// 没有互斥：线程 A 和 B 可能同时修改 balance&#10;//           结果取决于谁先写回 → 不确定行为&#10;&#10;// 有互斥：线程 A 和 B 的操作被强制排序&#10;//         A 先完成，B 再执行 → 确定性行为&#10;&#10;函数 取款(账户, 金额):&#10;    获取锁(账户.锁)       // 进入临界区&#10;    如果 账户.余额 &gt;= 金额:&#10;        账户.余额 -= 金额&#10;        结果 = 成功&#10;    否则:&#10;        结果 = 余额不足&#10;    释放锁(账户.锁)       // 离开临界区&#10;    返回 结果\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 互斥的本质：将并行操作串行化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 没有互斥：线程 A 和 B 可能同时修改 balance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//           结果取决于谁先写回 → 不确定行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 有互斥：线程 A 和 B 的操作被强制排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//         A 先完成，B 再执行 → 确定性行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>函数 取款(账户, 金额):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(账户.锁)       // 进入临界区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    如果 账户.余额 >= 金额:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        账户.余额 -= 金额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        结果 = 成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    否则:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        结果 = 余额不足</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    释放锁(账户.锁)       // 离开临界区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    返回 结果</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant R as Shared Resource&#10;    participant A as Thread A&#10;    participant B as Thread B&#10;&#10;    Note over R: Critical Section Free&#10;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;R: Acquire Lock → Enter Critical Section&#10;    Note over A,R: Thread A Exclusive Access&#10;&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;R: Try to Acquire Lock&#10;    Note over B: ❌ Rejected, Waiting&#10;&#10;    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)&#10;        A-&gt;&gt;R: Read Data&#10;        A-&gt;&gt;R: Modify Data&#10;        A-&gt;&gt;R: Write Back Data&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;R: Release Lock → Leave Critical Section&#10;&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;R: Acquire Lock → Enter Critical Section&#10;    Note over B,R: Thread B Exclusive Access&#10;&#10;    rect rgb(219, 234, 254)&#10;        B-&gt;&gt;R: Read Data (Sees Value Modified by A)&#10;        B-&gt;&gt;R: Modify Data&#10;        B-&gt;&gt;R: Write Back Data&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;R: Release Lock → Leave Critical Section\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant R as Shared Resource\n    participant A as Thread A\n    participant B as Thread B\n\n    Note over R: Critical Section Free\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;R: Acquire Lock → Enter Critical Section\n    Note over A,R: Thread A Exclusive Access\n\n    B-&gt;&gt;R: Try to Acquire Lock\n    Note over B: ❌ Rejected, Waiting\n\n    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)\n        A-&gt;&gt;R: Read Data\n        A-&gt;&gt;R: Modify Data\n        A-&gt;&gt;R: Write Back Data\n    end\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;R: Release Lock → Leave Critical Section\n\n    B-&gt;&gt;R: Acquire Lock → Enter Critical Section\n    Note over B,R: Thread B Exclusive Access\n\n    rect rgb(219, 234, 254)\n        B-&gt;&gt;R: Read Data (Sees Value Modified by A)\n        B-&gt;&gt;R: Modify Data\n        B-&gt;&gt;R: Write Back Data\n    end\n\n    B-&gt;&gt;R: Release Lock → Leave Critical Section</pre><h3 id=\"思想二-阻塞与等待策略\">思想二：阻塞与等待策略</h3><p>当一个线程无法获取锁时，它需要<strong>等待</strong>。不同的等待策略对应不同类型的锁，选择哪种策略取决于<strong>预期等待时间</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">等待策略</th>\n<th align=\"left\">机制</th>\n<th align=\"left\">CPU 使用</th>\n<th align=\"left\">延迟</th>\n<th align=\"left\">适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>阻塞等待</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">线程挂起，让出 CPU</td>\n<td align=\"left\">低（不占 CPU）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">高（唤醒有延迟）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">长临界区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>自旋等待</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">循环检查锁状态</td>\n<td align=\"left\">高（持续占 CPU）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">低（立即获取）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">短临界区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>混合策略</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">先自旋一段时间，再阻塞</td>\n<td align=\"left\">自适应</td>\n<td align=\"left\">自适应</td>\n<td align=\"left\">不确定长度的临界区</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    FAIL[&quot;Lock Acquisition Failed&quot;]&#10;&#10;    FAIL --&gt; Q{&quot;Expected Wait Time?&quot;}&#10;&#10;    Q --&gt;|&quot;Very Short&lt;br/&gt;(Tens of Nanoseconds)&quot;| SPIN[&quot;Spin Wait&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt;|&quot;Longer&lt;br/&gt;(Microseconds or More)&quot;| BLOCK[&quot;Blocking Wait&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt;|&quot;Uncertain&quot;| HYBRID[&quot;Hybrid Strategy&quot;]&#10;&#10;    SPIN --&gt; SPIN_DESC[&quot;Loop Check Lock State&lt;br/&gt;Acquire Immediately Once Released&lt;br/&gt;⚠️ Wastes CPU Cycles&quot;]&#10;&#10;    BLOCK --&gt; BLOCK_DESC[&quot;Thread Suspended, Yields CPU&lt;br/&gt;OS Wakes Up When Lock Released&lt;br/&gt;⚠️ Wakeup Latency ~Microseconds&quot;]&#10;&#10;    HYBRID --&gt; HYBRID_DESC[&quot;Spin N Times First&lt;br/&gt;Switch to Blocking if Still Not Acquired&lt;br/&gt;✅ Balances CPU and Latency&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    FAIL[\"Lock Acquisition Failed\"]\n\n    FAIL --&gt; Q{\"Expected Wait Time?\"}\n\n    Q --&gt;|\"Very Short&lt;br/&gt;(Tens of Nanoseconds)\"| SPIN[\"Spin Wait\"]\n    Q --&gt;|\"Longer&lt;br/&gt;(Microseconds or More)\"| BLOCK[\"Blocking Wait\"]\n    Q --&gt;|\"Uncertain\"| HYBRID[\"Hybrid Strategy\"]\n\n    SPIN --&gt; SPIN_DESC[\"Loop Check Lock State&lt;br/&gt;Acquire Immediately Once Released&lt;br/&gt;⚠️ Wastes CPU Cycles\"]\n\n    BLOCK --&gt; BLOCK_DESC[\"Thread Suspended, Yields CPU&lt;br/&gt;OS Wakes Up When Lock Released&lt;br/&gt;⚠️ Wakeup Latency ~Microseconds\"]\n\n    HYBRID --&gt; HYBRID_DESC[\"Spin N Times First&lt;br/&gt;Switch to Blocking if Still Not Acquired&lt;br/&gt;✅ Balances CPU and Latency\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 混合策略的伪实现&#10;class AdaptiveLock {&#10;  private locked = new AtomicInteger(0);&#10;  private spinLimit = 100;&#10;&#10;  lock(): void {&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; this.spinLimit; i++) {&#10;      if (this.locked.compareAndSwap(0, 1)) {&#10;        return;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;    this.blockingWait();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private blockingWait(): void {&#10;    while (!this.locked.compareAndSwap(0, 1)) {&#10;      parkThread();&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  unlock(): void {&#10;    this.locked.store(0);&#10;    wakeWaitingThread();&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 混合策略的伪实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AdaptiveLock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> locked</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AtomicInteger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> spinLimit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  lock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.spinLimit; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.locked.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compareAndSwap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">blockingWait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> blockingWait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.locked.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compareAndSwap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      parkThread</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  unlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.locked.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">store</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    wakeWaitingThread</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"思想三-死锁预防\">思想三：死锁预防</h3><p><strong>死锁（Deadlock）</strong> 是锁使用中最危险的问题——两个或多个线程互相等待对方释放锁，导致所有线程永久阻塞。</p>\n<h4 id=\"死锁的四个必要条件\">死锁的四个必要条件</h4><p>死锁的发生需要<strong>同时满足</strong>以下四个条件。只要打破其中任何一个，就不会发生死锁：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">条件</th>\n<th align=\"left\">含义</th>\n<th align=\"left\">打破方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>互斥</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">资源一次只能被一个线程使用</td>\n<td align=\"left\">使用共享资源（如读写锁的读模式）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>持有并等待</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">线程持有一个锁的同时等待另一个锁</td>\n<td align=\"left\">一次性获取所有需要的锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>不可抢占</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">已获取的锁不能被其他线程强行夺取</td>\n<td align=\"left\">使用 tryLock（超时放弃）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>循环等待</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">线程之间形成锁的环形等待链</td>\n<td align=\"left\">按固定顺序获取锁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;Deadlock Circular Wait&quot;&#10;        A[&quot;Thread A&lt;br/&gt;Holds Lock 1&lt;br/&gt;Waits for Lock 2&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;Thread B&lt;br/&gt;Holds Lock 2&lt;br/&gt;Waits for Lock 1&quot;]&#10;&#10;        A --&gt;|&quot;Wait&quot;| B&#10;        B --&gt;|&quot;Wait&quot;| A&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph \"Deadlock Circular Wait\"\n        A[\"Thread A&lt;br/&gt;Holds Lock 1&lt;br/&gt;Waits for Lock 2\"]\n        B[\"Thread B&lt;br/&gt;Holds Lock 2&lt;br/&gt;Waits for Lock 1\"]\n\n        A --&gt;|\"Wait\"| B\n        B --&gt;|\"Wait\"| A\n    end</pre><p>经典的死锁场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// ❌ 死锁示例：两个线程以不同顺序获取两把锁&#10;线程 A:&#10;    获取锁(锁1)&#10;    获取锁(锁2)    // 等待线程 B 释放 锁2&#10;    ...&#10;    释放锁(锁2)&#10;    释放锁(锁1)&#10;&#10;线程 B:&#10;    获取锁(锁2)&#10;    获取锁(锁1)    // 等待线程 A 释放 锁1&#10;    ...&#10;    释放锁(锁1)&#10;    释放锁(锁2)&#10;&#10;// 线程 A 持有 锁1 等待 锁2&#10;// 线程 B 持有 锁2 等待 锁1&#10;// → 循环等待 → 死锁！\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 死锁示例：两个线程以不同顺序获取两把锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程 A:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁2)    // 等待线程 B 释放 锁2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    释放锁(锁2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    释放锁(锁1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程 B:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁1)    // 等待线程 A 释放 锁1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    释放锁(锁1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    释放锁(锁2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 线程 A 持有 锁1 等待 锁2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 线程 B 持有 锁2 等待 锁1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// → 循环等待 → 死锁！</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"预防死锁的策略\">预防死锁的策略</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// ✅ 策略 1：固定加锁顺序&#10;// 所有线程都按 锁1 → 锁2 的顺序获取&#10;线程 A:&#10;    获取锁(锁1)&#10;    获取锁(锁2)&#10;    ...&#10;&#10;线程 B:&#10;    获取锁(锁1)    // 不再先获取 锁2&#10;    获取锁(锁2)&#10;    ...&#10;&#10;// ✅ 策略 2：使用 tryLock 超时机制&#10;线程 A:&#10;    获取锁(锁1)&#10;    如果 尝试获取锁(锁2, 超时=100毫秒) 失败:&#10;        释放锁(锁1)     // 放弃已持有的锁，避免死锁&#10;        稍后重试&#10;&#10;// ✅ 策略 3：一次性获取所有锁&#10;函数 安全转账(账户A, 账户B, 金额):&#10;    // 按账户 ID 排序，保证固定加锁顺序&#10;    (先锁, 后锁) = 排序(账户A.锁, 账户B.锁)&#10;    获取锁(先锁)&#10;    获取锁(后锁)&#10;    执行转账&#10;    释放锁(后锁)&#10;    释放锁(先锁)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 策略 1：固定加锁顺序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 所有线程都按 锁1 → 锁2 的顺序获取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程 A:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程 B:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁1)    // 不再先获取 锁2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 策略 2：使用 tryLock 超时机制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程 A:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    如果 尝试获取锁(锁2, 超时=100毫秒) 失败:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        释放锁(锁1)     // 放弃已持有的锁，避免死锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        稍后重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 策略 3：一次性获取所有锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>函数 安全转账(账户A, 账户B, 金额):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 按账户 ID 排序，保证固定加锁顺序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (先锁, 后锁) = 排序(账户A.锁, 账户B.锁)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(先锁)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(后锁)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    执行转账</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    释放锁(后锁)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    释放锁(先锁)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"分类与变体\">分类与变体</h2><h3 id=\"死锁检测图\">死锁检测图</h3><p>在复杂系统中，可以通过<strong>资源分配图</strong>来检测是否存在死锁。如果图中存在环，则说明存在死锁：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;No Deadlock ✅&quot;&#10;        direction LR&#10;        T1_OK[&quot;Thread 1&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Holds&quot;| R1_OK[&quot;Resource A&quot;]&#10;        T1_OK --&gt;|&quot;Waits&quot;| R2_OK[&quot;Resource B&quot;]&#10;        T2_OK[&quot;Thread 2&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Holds&quot;| R2_OK&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;Deadlock ❌&quot;&#10;        direction LR&#10;        T1_DL[&quot;Thread 1&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Holds&quot;| R1_DL[&quot;Resource A&quot;]&#10;        T1_DL --&gt;|&quot;Waits&quot;| R2_DL[&quot;Resource B&quot;]&#10;        T2_DL[&quot;Thread 2&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Holds&quot;| R2_DL&#10;        T2_DL --&gt;|&quot;Waits&quot;| R1_DL&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"No Deadlock ✅\"\n        direction LR\n        T1_OK[\"Thread 1\"] --&gt;|\"Holds\"| R1_OK[\"Resource A\"]\n        T1_OK --&gt;|\"Waits\"| R2_OK[\"Resource B\"]\n        T2_OK[\"Thread 2\"] --&gt;|\"Holds\"| R2_OK\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Deadlock ❌\"\n        direction LR\n        T1_DL[\"Thread 1\"] --&gt;|\"Holds\"| R1_DL[\"Resource A\"]\n        T1_DL --&gt;|\"Waits\"| R2_DL[\"Resource B\"]\n        T2_DL[\"Thread 2\"] --&gt;|\"Holds\"| R2_DL\n        T2_DL --&gt;|\"Waits\"| R1_DL\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"活锁与饥饿\">活锁与饥饿</h3><p>除了死锁，锁还可能导致其他活性问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">问题</th>\n<th align=\"left\">描述</th>\n<th align=\"left\">示例</th>\n<th align=\"left\">解决方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>死锁</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">线程互相等待，永久阻塞</td>\n<td align=\"left\">A 等 B，B 等 A</td>\n<td align=\"left\">固定顺序、超时、检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>活锁</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">线程不断重试但都无法推进</td>\n<td align=\"left\">A 和 B 不断互相让路</td>\n<td align=\"left\">引入随机退避</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>饥饿</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">某些线程长期无法获取锁</td>\n<td align=\"left\">高优先级线程反复插队</td>\n<td align=\"left\">使用公平锁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 活锁示例：两个&quot;礼貌&quot;的线程不断互相让路&#10;线程 A:&#10;    重复:&#10;        获取锁(锁1)&#10;        如果 尝试获取(锁2) 失败:&#10;            释放锁(锁1)     // &quot;让路&quot;&#10;            // 但线程 B 也在同一时刻让路...&#10;            // 然后两者又同时重试 → 再次失败 → 再让路...&#10;&#10;// ✅ 解决活锁：引入随机退避&#10;线程 A:&#10;    重复:&#10;        获取锁(锁1)&#10;        如果 尝试获取(锁2) 失败:&#10;            释放锁(锁1)&#10;            等待(随机时间)   // 随机退避打破同步\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 活锁示例：两个\"礼貌\"的线程不断互相让路</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程 A:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    重复:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        获取锁(锁1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        如果 尝试获取(锁2) 失败:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            释放锁(锁1)     // \"让路\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 但线程 B 也在同一时刻让路...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 然后两者又同时重试 → 再次失败 → 再让路...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 解决活锁：引入随机退避</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程 A:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    重复:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        获取锁(锁1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        如果 尝试获取(锁2) 失败:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            释放锁(锁1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            等待(随机时间)   // 随机退避打破同步</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"工作流程\">工作流程</h2><h3 id=\"锁的使用最佳实践流程\">锁的使用最佳实践流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[&quot;Need to Protect Shared Resources&quot;]&#10;&#10;    Q1{&quot;How Many Variables&lt;br/&gt;Does the Operation Involve?&quot;}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&quot;Single Simple Variable&quot;| ATOMIC[&quot;Consider Using Atomic Operations&quot;]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&quot;Multiple Variables/Complex Operations&quot;| LOCK[&quot;Use a Lock&quot;]&#10;&#10;    LOCK --&gt; Q2{&quot;Read/Write Ratio?&quot;}&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;Read-Heavy, Write-Light&quot;| RW[&quot;Read-Write Lock&quot;]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;Balanced/Write-Heavy&quot;| MUTEX[&quot;Mutex&quot;]&#10;&#10;    MUTEX --&gt; Q3{&quot;Critical Section Length?&quot;}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|&quot;Very Short (Nanoseconds)&quot;| SPIN[&quot;Spinlock&quot;]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|&quot;Longer (Microseconds+)&quot;| BLOCKING[&quot;Blocking Lock&quot;]&#10;&#10;    LOCK --&gt; RULES[&quot;Follow Usage Rules&quot;]&#10;    RULES --&gt; R1[&quot;Minimize Critical Section&quot;]&#10;    RULES --&gt; R2[&quot;Fix Lock Ordering&quot;]&#10;    RULES --&gt; R3[&quot;Avoid Calling External Functions in Critical Section&quot;]&#10;    RULES --&gt; R4[&quot;Always Release Lock in finally&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    START[\"Need to Protect Shared Resources\"]\n\n    Q1{\"How Many Variables&lt;br/&gt;Does the Operation Involve?\"}\n    Q1 --&gt;|\"Single Simple Variable\"| ATOMIC[\"Consider Using Atomic Operations\"]\n    Q1 --&gt;|\"Multiple Variables/Complex Operations\"| LOCK[\"Use a Lock\"]\n\n    LOCK --&gt; Q2{\"Read/Write Ratio?\"}\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"Read-Heavy, Write-Light\"| RW[\"Read-Write Lock\"]\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"Balanced/Write-Heavy\"| MUTEX[\"Mutex\"]\n\n    MUTEX --&gt; Q3{\"Critical Section Length?\"}\n    Q3 --&gt;|\"Very Short (Nanoseconds)\"| SPIN[\"Spinlock\"]\n    Q3 --&gt;|\"Longer (Microseconds+)\"| BLOCKING[\"Blocking Lock\"]\n\n    LOCK --&gt; RULES[\"Follow Usage Rules\"]\n    RULES --&gt; R1[\"Minimize Critical Section\"]\n    RULES --&gt; R2[\"Fix Lock Ordering\"]\n    RULES --&gt; R3[\"Avoid Calling External Functions in Critical Section\"]\n    RULES --&gt; R4[\"Always Release Lock in finally\"]</pre><h3 id=\"锁的安全使用模式\">锁的安全使用模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// ✅ 安全的锁使用模式：try-finally 保证释放&#10;function safeOperation(lock: Mutex): void {&#10;  lock.lock();&#10;  try {&#10;    doSomethingWithSharedResource();&#10;  } finally {&#10;    lock.unlock();&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ✅ 使用 RAII 模式自动管理锁（推荐）&#10;function withLock&lt;T&gt;(lock: Mutex, operation: () =&gt; T): T {&#10;  lock.lock();&#10;  try {&#10;    return operation();&#10;  } finally {&#10;    lock.unlock();&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;const result = withLock(mutex, () =&gt; {&#10;  return readAndModifySharedData();&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 安全的锁使用模式：try-finally 保证释放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> safeOperation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lock</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Mutex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lock.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    doSomethingWithSharedResource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lock.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 使用 RAII 模式自动管理锁（推荐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> withLock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lock</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Mutex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">operation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lock.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> operation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lock.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> withLock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mutex, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> readAndModifySharedData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"优劣对比\">优劣对比</h2><h3 id=\"锁-vs-无锁\">锁 vs 无锁</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">维度</th>\n<th align=\"left\">锁</th>\n<th align=\"left\">无锁（原子操作）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>通用性</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">可保护任意复杂的操作</td>\n<td align=\"left\">仅限单变量简单操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>性能上限</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">受限于串行化开销</td>\n<td align=\"left\">接近硬件极限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>死锁风险</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">有</td>\n<td align=\"left\">无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>编程难度</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">较低（语义直观）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">较高（需理解内存模型）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>可调试性</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">较好（可加日志）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">较差（时序敏感）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>适用规模</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">任意</td>\n<td align=\"left\">小规模、简单场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Three Core Ideas&#10;        M[&quot;Mutual Exclusion&lt;br/&gt;One Thread at a Time&quot;]&#10;        W[&quot;Waiting Strategy&lt;br/&gt;Blocking/Spinning/Hybrid&quot;]&#10;        D[&quot;Deadlock Prevention&lt;br/&gt;Break One of Four Conditions&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Liveness Problems&#10;        DL[&quot;Deadlock: Mutual Waiting&quot;]&#10;        LL[&quot;Livelock: Continuous Retrying&quot;]&#10;        ST[&quot;Starvation: Long-term Inability to Acquire&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    M ~~~ W ~~~ D&#10;    DL ~~~ LL ~~~ ST\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Three Core Ideas\n        M[\"Mutual Exclusion&lt;br/&gt;One Thread at a Time\"]\n        W[\"Waiting Strategy&lt;br/&gt;Blocking/Spinning/Hybrid\"]\n        D[\"Deadlock Prevention&lt;br/&gt;Break One of Four Conditions\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Liveness Problems\n        DL[\"Deadlock: Mutual Waiting\"]\n        LL[\"Livelock: Continuous Retrying\"]\n        ST[\"Starvation: Long-term Inability to Acquire\"]\n    end\n\n    M ~~~ W ~~~ D\n    DL ~~~ LL ~~~ ST</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>互斥</strong>是锁最核心的思想——确保同一时刻只有一个线程可以访问临界区</li>\n<li><strong>等待策略</strong>决定了线程获取锁失败后的行为：阻塞等待适合长临界区，自旋等待适合短临界区，混合策略兼顾两者</li>\n<li><strong>死锁</strong>是锁使用中最严重的问题，需要同时满足四个条件才能发生：互斥、持有并等待、不可抢占、循环等待</li>\n<li>通过<strong>固定加锁顺序、超时放弃、一次性获取所有锁</strong>等策略可以有效预防死锁</li>\n<li>除死锁外，还需关注<strong>活锁</strong>（不断重试但无法推进）和<strong>饥饿</strong>（长期无法获取锁）问题</li>\n<li>安全使用锁的关键原则：最小化临界区、固定加锁顺序、在 finally 中释放锁</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"锁的核心思想","id":"锁的核心思想"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心原理","id":"核心原理"},{"level":3,"text":"思想一：互斥（Mutual Exclusion）","id":"思想一-互斥-mutual-exclusion"},{"level":3,"text":"思想二：阻塞与等待策略","id":"思想二-阻塞与等待策略"},{"level":3,"text":"思想三：死锁预防","id":"思想三-死锁预防"},{"level":4,"text":"死锁的四个必要条件","id":"死锁的四个必要条件"},{"level":4,"text":"预防死锁的策略","id":"预防死锁的策略"},{"level":2,"text":"分类与变体","id":"分类与变体"},{"level":3,"text":"死锁检测图","id":"死锁检测图"},{"level":3,"text":"活锁与饥饿","id":"活锁与饥饿"},{"level":2,"text":"工作流程","id":"工作流程"},{"level":3,"text":"锁的使用最佳实践流程","id":"锁的使用最佳实践流程"},{"level":3,"text":"锁的安全使用模式","id":"锁的安全使用模式"},{"level":2,"text":"优劣对比","id":"优劣对比"},{"level":3,"text":"锁 vs 无锁","id":"锁-vs-无锁"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"锁的定义与核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/locks/lock-definition-and-concepts"},"next":{"title":"锁的实现机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/locks/lock-implementation"}}